  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prepare cake according to package instructions for three 8-inch round cakes. Bake according to package directions. Cool on a wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the frosting: Beat egg white, sugar, and strawberries together in a large bowl on high speed until very stiff peaks form, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place one cake layer on a serving plate; insert several toothpicks evenly on top of cake; this will help hold layers together. Frost with 1/4 of the frosting. Repeat with second layer. Place third layer on top; frost top and sides of cake with remaining 3/4 of frosting.",
